  # category coverage; runtime projection exposes `required_categories_profile`
  # as `legacy`, `canonical`, or `invalid` for operator diagnostics.
  # Omit `required_categories` only to select the legacy fallback profile.
  # Explicit lists must use one exact ordered profile; duplicates, unknown
  # categories, subsets, and reordered values fail closed with typed blockers.
  # Allowed profiles:
